        "text": "Arthur White (born December 1933) is an English stage and screen actor, best known for his occasional role as police archivist Ernie Trigg in the crime drama \"A Touch of Frost\", alongside his real-life younger brother. Arthur's brother is best known for his portrayal of the character Derek Trotter who was known by a nickname, in the British television series written by John Sullivan. In the series Denzil Tulser is a good friend of the character with a nickname.",
